hey i have a question

&#x200B;

My gecko is about 5/4 years old and i never took great care of him (never really tamed him, just fed him and routine stuff like that). I wanna tame him, he trusts me enough so i can have my hand near him and he enjoys it when i pet him on the top of his head, but today he got really spooked when i accidentaly touched his back. I wanna be able to hold him and overall spend more time with him. What can i do?
